{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:14 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:14 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:14 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9096d86ef0ddc9b53830fecbdcb0bcba/2026-11/page_222.jpg\"/><p>沙田發生翻車意外。今日（26日）早上7時45分，兩輛私家車在沙田路往馬鞍山方向、近博康邨相撞，其中一車向右翻側，另一車更翻轉四輪朝天。救援人員接報指有人被困，趕到現場救援，幸發現一名司機受輕傷清醒，其後將傷者送院。警方正調查事原因。</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/feaf74aaea3319a68836b780ac83d7a4/2026-11/2_2_106.jpg\"/><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48394095fe3e626b51bbf57dc5e4cbc3/2026-11/3_92.jpg\"/><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b6959e734690e9fb6fbaf941584c90e/2026-11/1_4_112.jpg\"/><img alt=\"涉事車輛其後由拖車拖走。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/05a3c177ad5e02ddbd041fc6b36253a2/2026-11/5_1_9.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事車輛由拖車拖走。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/42c85e1f608164483ea83e272e46b4c5/2026-11/4_1_9.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/15a1b24971a466b6bd40ba552926108c/2026-11/3_3_13.jpeg\"/><p>受事故影響期間，運輸署宣布，沙田路往馬鞍山方向近新田圍的全線需要封閉，獅子山隧道往沙田方向亦實施間歇性封閉，交通擠塞；呼籲駕駛人士考慮改用其他道路，例如青沙公路或大老山隧道。</p><img alt=\"拖車拖走涉事車輛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b28154407165418ff9e8a630a5d30009/2026-11/2_0_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/96a3c9ba2eee63d4cd7933dfcabdd0c7/2026-11/1_4_18.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9d9290dcc307053f4822d92a217acf36/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_08_55_33.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be1a8e2a82349a19d062d10749086fe7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_08_55_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ce7d178d261a4a1b718f3e704a30366/2026-11/3_0_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60b86556ab297c217211d1c51209fe69/2026-11/2_30.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ab538d0c3cd976ee4cc7c6cc9858c9c/2026-11/1_1_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1532e8c0d65ed6e5b1a06b93e02b86ac/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_08_33_23_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T01:18:06.369329+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T00:14:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T01:11:40.068953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T01:11:40.068953+00:00","content_hash":"bcbe6f2496ab7df0c765a6938bfd89874a53227a74a190907f5e803f89b3d6e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}